Package: plspower
Type: Shiny Application
Title: Monte Carlo Power Analysis Planner for PLS-SEM
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Fritz Jeffry", "Briones", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "mrcute808@gmail.com")
Description: A Shiny application for prospective Monte Carlo power analysis
    of PLS-SEM mediation models. Compares bootstrap-based and normal-theory
    PLS-SEM power against regression-based shortcuts (G*Power-equivalent
    f2 calculation) and the Kock-Hadaya inverse square-root rule, with a
    built-in smoke-test fixture, seed-controlled reproducibility, and
    CSV/JSON export.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
